/**
 * The online kit of "Feito para agentes" (volume 11), as data. The page is
 * pages/BookKit.jsx, at /books/feito-para-agentes/kit.
 *
 * Written on 01/11/2026 from the 0.1.0 book. A build kit like volume 10's
 * (data/kit-construir-com-ia.js): SYSTEM, the reader's product filled in
 * once, whose values go into every prompt that names it; and TRAIL, the
 * thirteen steps, each with the chapter's "Pronto quando" to tick.
 *
 * TASKS, TRAIL and TENS are generated by script from the chapters, never
 * retyped (learning/feito-para-agentes/research/gerar-kit.ts): every prompt is the code block printed in the chapter, word for
 * word, the print line breaks joined except where a line follows the end of
 * a sentence; each bracket is a field whose placeholder is the bracket's
 * text, and the four that name the reader's product ("[produto]",
 * "[endereço]", "[as três tarefas]", "[o modelo do seu cliente]") come from
 * SYSTEM. The checks of a prompt are the chapter's "O que ler na resposta, e
 * não no resumo" lines. Whoever edits a prompt here checks it against the
 * chapter.
 *
 * Unlike volume 10, this book ran tests: the transcripts, the analyses and
 * the run script are in public/books/feito-para-agentes/testes/, written by
 * script from research/testes/ with a 3-line header; the only thing taken
 * out is the path of the key file on the author's machine, marked
 * "[retirado]". The data is the fictional bakery's; a scan found no key, no
 * local path and no real person.
 *
 * The book is in data/books.json since it went on sale on 02/11/2026 (ASIN
 * B0HQ3XKG1H): the kit is the book's kit, no longer one opened by its address.
 */

